%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as adapter
  participant C as ApiClient
  participant P as provider API
  A->>C: read(request)
  C->>P: GET, 30s timeout
  P--xC: 503 or timeout
  Note over C: retryDecision: attempt 1, in budget
  C->>P: GET after 1s
  P-->>C: 200 body
  C-->>A: decoded value
  Note over A,P: mutate() never retries: lost reply is OutcomeUnknown
